From 7557958141d1a0d7dc8d2eb31d37cc5330f70ccd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stacho_P <stacho@venco.com.pl>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 12:45:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] qualcommax: add TP-Link Archer AX55 v1 (IPQ5018) on
 DWMAC+DSA base

Based on Julius's pcs-uniphy-psgmii-25m (kernel 6.12.92, mainline-aimed
DWMAC/UNIPHY ethernet infra for IPQ5018). Adds:
- DTS: WAN via internal GE PHY (gmac0), LAN via RTL8367S DSA over the 2.5G
  HSGMII trunk (gmac1/uniphy0), WiFi (2.4G + QCN6122 5G), NAND partitions.
- rtl8365mb SGMII/HSGMII patch (0918) - applies clean on the monolithic
  6.12.92 realtek driver; brings up the 2.5G trunk to the RTL8367S.
- rtl8367s-sgmii-firmware: 8051 SerDes init blob for the trunk.
- ax55-testdefaults: bring-up test defaults (LAN .3 + WAN .3 + WiFi AP), so
  the board is reachable over WAN/WiFi even if the RTL8367S LAN path fails.
- recipe, board.d, ath11k caldata.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
