@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+From: OpenWrt
+Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH] regmap: debugfs: allow register writes (AX55 bring-up aid)
+
+Turn the intentionally source-only REGMAP_ALLOW_WRITE_DEBUGFS switch on so
